DESCRIPTION:Shakespearean tropes. Climate breakdown. One unpredictable hour
  of improv. This isn’t your standard improv show. This isn't your traditi
 onal play about climate change\, either. This is an audience-led improvised
  performance where a collision of original characters\, born from Shakespea
 re's most enduring archetypes\, must navigate the pressures of a rapidly ch
 anging world. Join Edinburgh scholars for a lively discussion on Shakespear
 e's hidden environmental wisdom. Then\, your insights and thoughts become t
 he show! After the performance\, stick around to unpack what just happened.
  What insights might we take with us into our real lives?\nMore info: https
